  "description": "The fourth generation FlareMAX was our 29\" wheel, fast and fun downcountry, XC and short-travel trail bike: a punchy 125mm travel jack-of-all-trades, and the only bike you needed for ripping through the woods and conquering the hills. Reynolds 853 kept the frame responsive and Longshot geometry made it fiercely capable.\n\nRiders could choose 120mm forks and light tyres for the full downcountry experience, 130mm forks for a lively all-rounder, or 140mm forks and big 2.5\" tyres for a slacker, more capable ride.\n\nFinishes: Hubble Purple, Matte Slate Grey, Gritstone with Blue/Green, and Sydney Blue.",
